(text "Sheet 2: robot harness (battery, fuse, switch, INA226, E-stop relay, bucks, charger, Pi, motion\nboard connectors, motors, switches, servos, LED, buzzer).\nSheet 3: rack and spare station (mains, 24 V PSU, rack controller terminals, bay switches, E-stop,\ndock relay, lamps, station cables, dock contacts and station switches).\nSheet 4: ESP32 rack controller, the PLC fallback (P40), wired to the same terminal names.\n\nThe two sides meet only at the spare-station dock: robot pads J102 ↔ station contacts J202\n(24 V charging, switched by the rack's dock relay), and over Wi-Fi (Pi AP RACKBOT ↔ rack controller)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0c31dbb0-676c-5ad3-82ae-d06f4fa94a9b"))
